                                "sense_id": "cb4b1c08-cf17-34fe-a0ac-26cccde04220",
                                "text": "The solerets are wide-toed, […]; the wings of the elbow and knee-kops small. The inner bends of the elbow joints are furnished with a pliable protection of numerous very narrow plates."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b140d06d-dd79-4e2e-b0a1-b5a75e59170b",
                                "sense_id": "cb4b1c08-cf17-34fe-a0ac-26cccde04220",
                                "text": "1. Elbow Kop with rope-cable border.\n2. Part of left Pauldron (shoulder piece) with similar border."
                            }
                        ]
